---
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo/standard.css';
import '@fontsource/manrope/400.css';
import '@fontsource/manrope/500.css';
import '@fontsource/manrope/600.css';
import '../styles/global.css';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import ProjectArt from '../components/ProjectArt.astro';
import LinkageStudy from '../components/LinkageStudy.astro';
import { portfolio } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#111214" />
    <meta name="description" content="Francesco Trotti — inventor and engineer exploring robotics, AI, and embedded systems. Building T labs. Building to serve the world." />
    <title>{portfolio.name} — Inventor. Scientist. Engineer.</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="notebook-registration" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label={`${portfolio.name} — home`}>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 34 34" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12V3h9m10 0h9v9m0 10v9h-9m-10 0H3v-9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="m11 21 6-10 6 10m-10-3h8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
        <span>{portfolio.name}</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#tlabs">T labs <span class="nav-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a href="#about">About <Arrow /></a></nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 id="hero-title">WHAT<br /><span>IF?</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-identity">Inventor. Scientist. Engineer.</p>
          <p class="hero-mission">{portfolio.mission}</p>
          <a class="text-link hero-link" href="#work">Explore the work <Arrow direction="down" /></a>
        </div>
        <LinkageStudy />
        <div class="hero-note"><span class="note-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>A question is where<br />everything starts.</p></div>
        <div class="hero-bottom"><span>Robotics / AI / Embedded systems</span><span class="hero-scroll">A little further down <Arrow direction="down" /></span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="work-section section-wrap" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="work-title">Ideas made tangible<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p>The work will live here.<br />For now, a look at the territory.</p></div>
        <div class="project-grid">
          {portfolio.projects.map((project, index) => <article class:list={['project', { 'project-featured': index === 0 }]} id={`project-${project.id}`}>
            <div class="project-art"><ProjectArt kind={project.image} /><span class="art-caption">Illustrative study — not project imagery</span><span class="placeholder-tag">Project placeholder</span></div>
            <div class="project-body"><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.description}</p><span class="discipline">{project.discipline}</span><details><summary>What will go here <span class="details-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="project-details"><p>{project.placeholder}</p><p>No project has been published in this slot yet.</p></div></details></div>
          </article>)}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="approach-section" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div class="section-wrap approach-layout">
          <div class="approach-intro"><h2 id="approach-title">From signal<br />to <span>movement.</span></h2><p>Software doesn’t have to stop at the screen.</p></div>
          <div class="approach-content"><p class="large-copy">I’m drawn to the connections: intelligence that understands, electronics that respond, and mechanisms that act.</p><div class="discipline-row"><h3>Robotics</h3><p>Giving ideas a physical form.</p></div><div class="discipline-row"><h3>AI</h3><p>Exploring how machines can understand.</p></div><div class="discipline-row"><h3>Embedded</h3><p>Connecting software to the real world.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tlabs-section section-wrap" id="tlabs" aria-labelledby="tlabs-title">
        <div class="tlabs-panel">
          <div class="tlabs-heading"><h2 id="tlabs-title">T<span class="labs-word"> labs</span><span class="accent">.</span></h2><span class="venture-note">The venture I’m building</span></div>
          <div class="tlabs-body"><h3>Technology should<br />help the world.</h3><p>{portfolio.startup.description}</p><p class="tlabs-footnote">An ambition to build toward.<br />Not a claim of products or impact already delivered.</p><a class="text-link" href="#about">Meet the person behind it <Arrow /></a></div>
          <svg class="tlabs-orbit" viewBox="0 0 600 600" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="300" cy="300" r="240"/><circle cx="300" cy="300" r="180"/><circle cx="300" cy="300" r="120"/><path d="M0 300h600M300 0v600"/><circle cx="300" cy="300" r="9" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section section-wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <div class="about-heading"><h2 id="about-title">A mind for systems.<br /><span>A reason to build.</span></h2><div class="signature">{portfolio.name}<span>Engineer · Building T labs</span></div></div>
        <div class="about-content"><p>{portfolio.introduction}</p><p>That curiosity is also behind T labs: a venture I’m building around robotics, AI, and the ambition to make technology useful to the world.</p><p class="placeholder-note">This is the beginning of the portfolio.<br />Real projects and a fuller story will follow.</p><a class="text-link" href="#work">Back to the work <Arrow /></a></div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><a class="footer-mission" href="#">Keep asking.<br /><span>Keep building.</span><Arrow /></a><div class="footer-bottom"><span>{portfolio.name} · Personal engineering portfolio</span><a href="#main">Back to top <Arrow /></a><span>Built with curiosity.</span></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
